Next steps:
  openclaw onboard            # pick a model provider, create your agent
  openclaw-service install    # keep the gateway running on the host
  openclaw-dashboard          # open the Control UI

To join this machine to a gateway elsewhere as a node instead:
  openclaw-node --pair "oc-pair://<setup-code>"
  openclaw-service node install --host <gateway-host>

